|----------|----------------|-------------------|-------------------|
| Old wound SDF | YES (64×/pixel) | 32KB (3D texture) | +6ms GPU |
| World grid perturbation | No | 0 | 0 but damage walks away |
| Damage marks (proposed) | NO (1×/pixel, shading only) | 320 bytes (20 × 16B) | +0.2ms GPU |

